[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2640.069, "timestamp": "00:44:00", "text": "她们在玩耍时非常合拍，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2642.309, "timestamp": "00:44:02", "text": "因为就我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2644.55, "timestamp": "00:44:04", "text": "所见，如果曾经有过一个猩红色的投手的话"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2646.95, "timestamp": "00:44:06", "text": "。 处理起来真是挺麻烦的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2650.79, "timestamp": "00:44:10", "text": "其次是何先生，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2653.19, "timestamp": "00:44:13", "text": "您为什么认为绯红女巫怎么可能"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2654.63, "timestamp": "00:44:14", "text": "是好人呢？ 这么说吧，你不是那种"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2656.39, "timestamp": "00:44:16", "text": "冲锋陷阵的前线人物，比如过来"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2658.069, "timestamp": "00:44:18", "text": "。   暂别了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2660.309, "timestamp": "00:44:20", "text": "，对吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2662.79, "timestamp": "00:44:22", "text": "？ 你又不是前线人员。 我们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2664.71, "timestamp": "00:44:24", "text": "H 怎么做？让我来告诉你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2667.589, "timestamp": "00:44:27", "text": "一些关于绿巨人的事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2669.349, "timestamp": "00:44:29", "text": "这个角色旨在孤立"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2671.03, "timestamp": "00:44:31", "text": "他人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2671.91, "timestamp": "00:44:31", "text": "哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2673.829, "timestamp": "00:44:33", "text": "原来他是在自我隔离。 我们就"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2676.47, "timestamp": "00:44:36", "text": "假设那边那个人是个治疗师吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2677.51, "timestamp": "00:44:37", "text": "好的，你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2680.47, "timestamp": "00:44:40", "text": "看。 看这里。 这家伙是个治疗师。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2682.55, "timestamp": "00:44:42", "text": "他想做的就是远离这里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2686.069, "timestamp": "00:44:46", "text": "他会直接冲进去，孤立"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2687.91, "timestamp": "00:44:47", "text": "目标"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2690.39, "timestamp": "00:44:50", "text": "并试图杀死他们。 如果你玩的是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2692.309, "timestamp": "00:44:52", "text": "猩红女巫，你会看到两种技能类型，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2695.589, "timestamp": "00:44:55", "text": "这个角色有两种不同的玩法风格。 好的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2697.109, "timestamp": "00:44:57", "text": "玩猩红岭有很多种玩家的职责，"}]